.env
*.log

# Python
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/db.sqlite3
**/staticfiles/
# Snapshots written by the admin panel's backup tool.
backend/backups/

# Node
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# tsc build artifacts (vite.config.js used to shadow vite.config.ts)
frontend/vite.config.js
frontend/vite.config.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo

# Didar CRM exports — the folder is tracked, its contents never are.
# These sheets carry ~1800 real customers' names, mobile numbers and deal
# values. Git history is permanent, so a commit here would keep that data in
# every clone forever, even after a later delete. They are uploaded to the
# server instead. See backend/data/didar/README.md.
backend/data/didar/*
!backend/data/didar/README.md
!backend/data/didar/.gitkeep
